    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>The psychophant lashes out with a brutal manifestation of psychic force, wracking its foes' psyches. Each creature within 30 feet of the psychophant must make a [[/save ability=int dc=16]] saving throw. On a failure, a creature takes 31 ([[/damage 9d6 type=psychic]]) damage and is &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 minute as it suffers a debilitating headache. On a success, a creature takes half the damage and isn't &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]. A &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p></div>",
